    {
      "tweet_id": "2027637911097839997",
      "blogger_id": "aleabitoreddit",
      "date": "2026-02-28",
      "created_at": "2026-02-28T01:52:04-05:00",
      "stance": "bullish",
      "mention_type": "explicit_stance",
      "reasons": [
        "immediate beneficiary of Israel-Iran conflict",
        "oil/energy play"
      ],
      "is_risk": false,
      "conviction": null,
      "raw_mention": "$XLE",
      "text": "Hope you all hedged with Pistachios.\n\nIsrael is now airstriking Iran. \n\nImmediate Beneficiaries: \nOil (Energy) - $XLE, $CVX, $XOM, \nDefense - $AVAV, $NOC, $LASR, $LPTH, $RTX, $AVAV, $LMT, $NOC\nSave Haven Assets - Gold, Silver\nShipping - $FRO, $STNG\nPistachios\n\nThis might just be a case of trading blows \n\n-> Israel fires some shows\n-> Iran fires some back \n-> they get shot down by the US so they can claim they retaliated\n\nThen all is well. \n\nMy opinion is markets freak out for the weekend and overnight but recover shortly after they realize war is bullish for America. \n\nBut if US follows-up and invades, then the Military/Oil trade is back.",
      "url": "https://x.com/aleabitoreddit/status/2027637911097839997",
      "kind": "post",
      "engagement": {
        "views": 100381,
        "likes": 845,
        "reposts": 62,
        "replies": 58
      },
      "extractor_model": "claude-opus-4-6",
